<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Shoprite Hold plans 10-for-one share split.</title>
<headline>Shoprite Hold plans 10-for-one share split.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shoprite Holdings Ltd said on Friday it planned a 10-for-one share split to increase the marketability and liquidity of the company's shares.</p>
<p>Subject to approval, the effective date of the split will be November 4.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
